{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S06、S08、S11等段压缩掉了重要的情绪转折和心理活动，把部分因果解释藏进小字，人物内心变化的细腻度有所下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的大字更像清晰的段落路标，反复使用“亲近”和“委屈”建立稳定的主题线索，观众即使不仔细读小字，也更容易抓住每段要点并理解全曲在讲什么。X则把人物的动机、心理因果和情绪变化直接放在大字中，为什么反复摇摆、每次情绪如何转折都交代得更充分，感受也更细腻。总体而言，Y更适合边听边扫的普通观众，但它确实以牺牲部分心理层次和叙事过程为代价。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4007d7c4-356f-4644-970a-f0e5a7b41644", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T190054182462Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:01:41.904584+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "40fd2cc9a144a23405edf82b41f4d4f27251508741bcb307bfaab68d4b264fea", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a